 they didn't like  them  simmons memorably played jay jonah  jameson in sam raimi's original trilogy  but despite it being the same character  kevin feige has made it clear that it is  not the same incarnation feige and watts  even made plans that if simmons turned  the role down that they'd have to  completely reinvent the character it's  great to have the opportunity as these  things evolve to  to be one of the holdovers from from the  previous version  barrick is one of the first openly trans  actors in the mcu he had actually  auditioned last minute but was quickly  cast and was flown out to film in london  he appreciated that his character's  gender identity didn't define his  personality and that he was simply just  along for the ride  audiences around the world have come to  love the cast of marvel studios  spider-man franchise and it's obvious  why the cast has come from all different  kinds of backgrounds giving the films a  diverse point of view it'd be hard for  us to picture a spider-man movie going  any other way who's your favorite actor  or actress from the spider-man films
 

